<p>Unleash a flurry of disruptive kicks at your target's vulnerable areas. For each combo point you attack for 10% weapon damage and deactivate one physical sustain.</p><p>At talent level 3 <span style="color: #9932cc"><span class="tstr-color-DARK_ORCHID">Magical</span></span> sustains will also be effected.</p><p>At talent level 5 <span style="color: #ffff00"><span class="tstr-color-YELLOW">Mental</span></span> sustains will also be effected.</p><p>Using this talent removes your combo points.</p>